    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p><strong>Learn more about CANN products and enjoy some of their non-infused, bubbly and delicious social tonics!</strong></p><ul><li>Highly social – Microdosed for the perfect effect</li><li>Hangover free – No painful days after drinking or regrets</li><li>Award-winning flavors – Lemon from Sicily, Yuzu from Japan, you get it…no cutting corners</li></ul><p>DRINKABLE, DELICIOUS CANNABIS THAT’S AS BUBBLY, REFRESHING, AND SOCIABLE AS YOUR FAVORITE COCKTAIL, BUT HOLD THE BOOZE – AND THE HANGOVER.</p><p><a href=\"/brands/cann/\"><strong>Click here to shop CANN products!</strong></a></p>"
